OL,16,G1800 Get It On with Bryan Burnett
OL,17,     FYou loved it at 16 and still love
OL,18,     Fit today. Your fashion has
OL,19,     Fchanged, your hair may have gone,
OL,20,     Fbut your love of this song has
OL,21,     Fremained. What's the song that's
OL,22,     Fstayed with you?
